umb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/170721_Hakone_Botanical_Garden_of_Wetlands_Hakone_Japan06.JPG/960px-170721_Hakone_Botanical_Garden_of_Wetlands_Hakone_Japan06.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:170721_Hakone_Botanical_Garden_of_Wetlands_Hakone_Japan06.JPG","artist":"663highland","license":"CC BY 2.5"},"t":[67,75]},{"id":"w957153548","name":"出戸公園","lat":35.27375,"lon":139.00725,"cat":"park","indoor":false,"f":["free"],"kid":0.65,"nov":1,"rich":0.4,"apl":0.2,"city":"箱根","t":[77]},{"id":"w388180518","name":"ポーラ美術館","lat":35.2567,"lon":139.0212,"cat":"museum","indoor":true,"f":["indoor"],"kid":0.7,"nov":0.55,"rich":0.95,"apl":1,"city":"箱根","web":"https://www.polamuseum.or.jp/","wd":"Q1574475","desc":"神奈川県箱根町にある美術館","wp":{"title":"ポーラ美術館","extract":"ポーラ美術館（ポーラびじゅつかん）は、神奈川県足柄下郡箱根町仙石原にある美術館。公益財団法人ポーラ美術振興財団が運営している。館長は野口弘子。"},"img":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/191103_Pola_Museum_of_Art_Hakone_Japan02s3.jpg/960px-191103_Pola_Museum_of_Art_Hakone_Japan02s3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:191103_Pola_Museum_of_Art_Hakone_Japan02s3.jpg","artist":"663highland","license":"CC BY 2.5"},"t":[74]},{"id":"w130886674","name":"箱根ガラスの森美術館","lat":35.26628,"lon":139.01762,"cat":"museum","indoor":true,"f":["indoor"],"kid":0.7,"nov":0.78,"rich":0.95,"apl":1,"city":"箱根","web":"https://www.hakone-garasunomori.jp/","wd":"Q11603346","desc":"神奈川県箱根町にある美術館","wp":{"title":"箱根ガラスの森","extract":"箱根ガラスの森（はこねガラスのもり）あるいは箱根ガラスの森美術館（はこねガラスのもりびじゅつかん）は、神奈川県足柄下郡箱根町仙石原に所在する、ヴェネチアングラスの美術館である。運営・管理はダイコク電機子会社の箱根ガラスの森リゾート。"},"img":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7e/Hakone_Venetian_Glass_Museum.jpg/960px-Hakone_Venetian_Glass_Museum.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedi